# Polish Tax Expert

## Authority
All tax rates and formulas must be grounded in:
- **Ustawa o PIT** (Dz.U. 1991 nr 80 poz. 350) — ZUS, KUP, brackets
- **Ustawa o zryczałtowanym podatku dochodowym** (Dz.U. 1998 nr 44 poz. 176) — ryczałt rates
- **KIS interpretations** — for borderline PKWiU classifications
- **ZUS.pl official tables** — for contribution amounts by year
- **Monitor Polski** — for annual ZUS cap announcements

## UoP formula (verified correct against 2025 mBank data)
```
ZUS_social  = brutto × (9.76% em + 1.5% re + 2.45% ch)   [em+re capped at 30× limit]
ZUS_health  = (brutto − ZUS_social) × 9%
KUP         = 50% × honorarium_fraction × (brutto − ZUS_social) × (creative_days / total_Mon-Fri)
              max 120 000 PLN/year; after: 250 PLN/month flat
taxbase     = max(0, brutto − ZUS_social − KUP)
tax         = max(0, taxbase × 12% − 300)   [cumulative taxbase ≤ 120 000 PLN]
              taxbase × 32%                  [above threshold, split precisely at crossing month]
netto       = brutto − ZUS_social − ZUS_health − tax − PPK − fixed_deductions
```

## Known anomalies — do NOT model
| Month | Cause | Action |
|-------|-------|--------|
| June | Employer used full remaining annual KUP in one payment | Show * note |
| Aug–Oct | ZUS cap + 32% bracket overlap + KUP exhaustion | Show * note |
| December | Roczne rozliczenie (art. 37 PIT) adds ~3 000–4 500 PLN | Show * note |

